or finds the solution: Christophe must wear an iron corset to keep himself upright. Forced to reinvent his life away from the farm, Christophe discovers a new passion for music, meets a new friend, and follows her into his first mischief.","genres":["Animation","Drama","Family"],"in_library":false,"ask":null,"fresh":{"kind":"new_release","text":"Out Oct 14"}},{"tmdb_id":"1487317","kind":"movie","name":"Therapy Done Right","year":2026,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/2gJiHJYhPXQy4ovDD5ZvSjwYfMZ.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/3eZQoaWm2cDE2QV02GUHUrWsxAC.jpg","overview":"A psychoanalyst who's lost faith in traditional therapy crosses every boundary to help a blocked novelist in this cutting Argentine dark comedy.","genres":["Comedy","Drama"],"in_library":false,"ask":null,"fresh":{"kind":"new_release","text":"Out Oct 8"},"trailer_key":"DgZQwmjdcp8"},{"tmdb_id":"1412795","kind":"movie","name":"The Spiral","year":2026,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/hkpxitZPz3cKQMl2g0MxzKQdtpP.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/jsnatGViKLWlW3iqr2wrZNWSrRB.jpg","overview":"On a stormy night in Rome, Anna arrives at her daughter Alice\u2019s apartment with a devastating confession: their entire family history is built on a lie. Twenty years earlier, after a horrific accident that nearly cost Alice her leg, Anna claims she made a pact with a mysterious Stranger to save her. But the miracle came at a price. What she believed was a single desperate bargain has in fact unleashed a spiraling chain reaction \u2014 a domino effect of increasingly dark events that have haunted their lives ever since. Now, the Stranger has come to collect. And Anna is convinced that only Alice can break the spiral and set things right. But at what cost?","genres":["Drama","Thriller"],"in_library":false,"ask":null,"fresh":{"kind":"new_release","text":"Out Oct 8"}}]},{"id":"np_services","type":"np_services","title":"Fresh on your services","items":[{"tmdb_id":"36218