. This time, he must solve it with a chaotic and troublesome team. As they struggle to work together and deal with the twists and turns of the case, the investigation takes them on a chaotic and unpredictable ride.","genres":["Comedy","Crime","Action"],"in_library":false,"ask":null,"fresh":{"kind":"new_release","text":"Out Nov 5"}},{"tmdb_id":"1794569","kind":"movie","name":"Unprotected: Murder in Galicia","year":2026,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/ljDe9CMzO7PpM86WOqIZzDfokgE.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/5DEE6tP6FOkgfjvoQYvjNjvt3cn.jpg","overview":"Documentary film that tells the story of Isabel Fuentes. In April 2015, alleged burglars left her on the brink of death in her own home, in the village of Pazos, in Ver\u00edn. From the very beginning, the Guardia Civil sergeant in charge of the case suspected that the account of what had happened did not add up and tried to protect Isabel from further attack.","genres":["Documentary","Crime"],"in_library":false,"ask":null,"fresh":{"kind":"new_release","text":"Out Nov 6"},"trailer_key":"V7qdKH-USL8"},{"tmdb_id":"1798383","kind":"movie","name":"Wolves Up Close with Bertie Gregory","year":2026,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/fopmDU345HPkMC9iUaNQEY0uRkk.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/8uRYkZe2pbQ3m0l7pwb52I2dJyB.jpg","overview":"Reconnecting with a pack of wolves he has followed for seven years, Bertie sets out to capture one of the Arctic's most dangerous and rarely filmed hunts: wolves taking on a bull moose, prey roughly ten times their size. Led by Kona, a striking white breeding male, the pack faces a critical winter as dwindling food supplies, an encroaching rival wolf and an aging leader threaten its survival.","genres":["Documentary"],"in_library":false,"ask":null,"fresh":{"kind":"new_release","text":"Out Nov 6"}},{"tmdb_id":"1585239","kind":"movie","name":"Club Kid","year":2026,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/o1qMU0ZB5XDX8IXJFFu3AkhOqjh.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/m5zcXuV4qR9fBgXjPndLIPOcasF.jpg","overview":"A hard-partying New York City club promoter sees his whirlwind lifestyle upended by the arrival of the 10-year-old son he never knew he had.","genres":["Comedy","Drama"],"in_library":false,"ask":null,"fresh":{"kind":"new_release","text":"Out Nov 4"},"trailer_key":"guKEdb_iRXw"},{"tmdb_id":"1571955","kind":"movie","name":"Collision Course","year":2026,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/s2eAK0uiODjlNUSIiOBwdp3at2u.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/uI3kWI7kGW5E0F8WduewgQYPt34.jpg","overview":"Spain, 2013. After robbing a bank, a getaway crash reveals the hidden side of each thief, exposing betrayals and lies that began long before the heist.","genres":["Thriller","Drama","Crime"],"in_library":false,"ask":null,"fresh":{"kind":"new_release","text":"Out Oct 30"},"trailer_key":"8hVLhaK619k"},{"tmdb_id":"1657630","kind":"movie","name":"The Awakening","year":2026,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/AhP971WogMHbF5iKJPKi6e6oaya.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/4pYKqctQvvdyhuGjiK4szH9jEv9.jpg","overview":"An elite military unit on a mission in the South American jungle encounters a deadly supernatural force revealing an ancient presence that continues to claim anyone who dares enter its domain.","genres":["Horror","Action","War","Fantasy","Thriller"],"in_library":false,"ask":null,"fresh":{"kind":"new_release","text":"Out Oct 29"},"trailer_key":"hj6Cer6bJUI"},{"tmdb_id":"1630420","kind":"movie","name":"Overacting","year":2026,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/rve2a7JXJbXivl0JakEWgc9Fhwh.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/5pMZA0EdgE66jcSCkfDCAtWiizk.jpg","overview":"When her father's memories as a retired top cop resurface, a struggling actress stages wild missions to keep him from pursuing his elusive archnemesis.","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy"],"in_library":false,"ask":null,"fresh":{"kind":"new_release","text":"Out Nov 4"}},{"tmdb_id":"1666787","kind":"movie","name":"Avedon","year":2026,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/ziyEHM0P1TgvhVXIqqguoMAD0TJ.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/8mdZuwDtyhidCrb7ffsfl0FLeoN.jpg","overview":"Richard Avedon's photographs didn't just reflect culture, they shaped it, and continue to do so. The feature documentary AVEDON traces the life and legacy of an artist who used fashion, portraiture, and commercial photography to explore identity, power, fear and beauty. With unprecedented access to Avedon's archive, including never before seen photos, behind the scenes recordings, and interviews with those who knew him best, AVEDON is a visually stunning examination of the mind of an artist who shaped our collective image of the 20th century.","genres":["Documentary"],"in_library":false,"ask":null,"fresh":{"kind":"new_release","text":"Out Nov 6"}},{"tmdb_id":"1760311","kind":"movie","name":"Barbie in the Nutcracker","year":2026,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/suSGUJNCgdVVjCXcJBDtjKxWTlg.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/aDc3Kd0nvII9feQjV0464jIO0ra.jpg","overview":"Barbie \u201cBrooklyn\u201d Roberts steps into the role of the Sugarplum Princess and Barbie \u201cMalibu\u201d Roberts stars as Clara, as they journey through a musical, magical dreamworld filled with holiday wonder, courage and friendship.","genres":["Animation","Family","Fantasy","Adventure"],"in_library":false,"ask":null,"fresh":{"kind":"new_release","text":"Out Oct 31"}},{"tmdb_id":"1816668","kind":"movie","name":"Ninho: Fame Ain\u2019t Worth It","year":2026,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/xy02UZTSEJWXeJXG4XGb4aWDxdP.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/vwGjInWZImDB2AQnnrIt9775q6L.jpg","overview":"At the height of his success in 2025, French rap star Ninho considers leaving music behind. This documentary looks back on the triumphs, sacrifices and personal challenges that brought him to that crossroads.","genres":["Docume